1 उ॑दित a. risen, high, elevated, haughty;
 begun, occurred,
appeared, manifest, clear.

2 उदित॑ a. said, spoken, proclaimed, taught;
 spoken to,
addressed.

उ॑दिति f. rising (of the sun);
 going away, setting (of the
sun);
 disappearance, end.

उदीच्य᳙ a. northern;
 m. the northern country, pl. its
inhabitants.

उदीच्य॑ a. northern;
 m. the northern country, pl. its
inhabitants.

उद्दिश्य (ger.) aiming at;
 used as prep. w. acc. = towards,
with regard to, for the sake of, concerning, about.
